<div id="abe-column-block-2b90d051-34f1-4be7-adae-02aa33df2aa7" class="abe-column-block" data-block-type="FancyBlockColumn" data-block-id="139586611" style="width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; display: inline-block; font-size: 16px; vertical-align: top;">
  <table width="100%" align="center" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation" style="table-layout: fixed; overflow-wrap: break-word; word-wrap: break-word; text-align: left; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; border-spacing: 0; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt;">
    <tr>
      <td class="abe-column-block-padding" id="abe-column-block-2b90d051-34f1-4be7-adae-02aa33df2aa7-padding" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; mso-table-lspace: 0pt; mso-table-rspace: 0pt; padding: 15px;">
<h1 style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 24px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 20px;">We Want to Hear From You! </h1>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Thank you and your student-athlete for participating in our youth basketball league! Please take this brief 20-second survey to help us improve these youth leagues. Providing feedback on your experience can help make sure the leagues offered meet and exceed expectations in the future.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSfVF5pjg_iMwMlkwrapciYWUOzBcWIyVb9EXgtz3bSNJg6DfA/viewform?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #9D4359;">Parent/Guardian/Adult Survey</a></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdYzi-EDQQj3N58LtQU9ssTZzQAievki5y8gE8QZ5-9J7ooTw/viewform?utm_medium=email&utm_source=govdelivery" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #9D4359;">Participant Survey</a></p>
<h1 class="govd_header" style="line-height: 1.2; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 24px; color: #00539B; margin: 0 0 20px;">Congratulations to our Youth Basketball League Playoff Finalist!</h1>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">Congratulations to all participants on an incredible season of CRPD Youth Basketball! After weeks of intense competition, we're thrilled to announce the champions and runners-up for the 2025 playoffs.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;">A huge round of applause to every player, coach and supporter who contributed to the excitement and sportsmanship throughout the 2025 season. Your dedication and passion for the game have made this year truly unforgettable. Click the links below to see champions and runner-ups for each age division.</p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong>10U Division </strong></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/OHCCC/2025/04/08/file_attachments/3223355/10U%20Champion%20-%20Glenwood.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #9D4359;">10U Champion - Glenwood Community Center</a></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/OHCCC/2025/04/08/file_attachments/3223338/10U%20Runner%20UP%20Barnett.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #9D4359;">10U Runner-Up - Barnett Community Center</a></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong>12U Division</strong></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/OHCCC/2025/04/08/file_attachments/3223356/12U%20Champion%20-%20Driving%20Park.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #9D4359;">12U Champion - Driving Park Community Center</a></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/OHCCC/2025/04/08/file_attachments/3223339/12U%20Runner%20Up-%20Glenwood.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #9D4359;">12U Runner-Up - Glenwood Community Center</a></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong>14U Division</strong></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/OHCCC/2025/04/08/file_attachments/3223357/14U%20Champion-%20Driving.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #9D4359;">14U Champion- Driving Park Community Center</a></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/OHCCC/2025/04/08/file_attachments/3223358/14U%20Runner%20Up%20-%20Woodward.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #9D4359;">14U Runner Up - Woodward Park Community Center</a></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><strong>18U Division</strong></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/OHCCC/2025/04/08/file_attachments/3223359/18U%20Champion%20Brentnell.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #9D4359;">18U Champion - Brentnell Community Center</a></p>
<p style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; line-height: 1.4; font-family: helvetica; font-size: 14px; color: #636467; margin: 0 0 15px;"><a href="https://content.govdelivery.com/attachments/OHCCC/2025/04/08/file_attachments/3223340/18U%20Runner%20Up%20City%20Life.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener" style="-webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; -ms-text-size-adjust: 100%; color: #9D4359;">18U Runner Up - City Life </a></p>
</td>
    </tr>
